1-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317257","source_hash":"3381de7fca981ec9686f3538ef8cc4a7c607462e81683ec057db473608ed3ae0","text":"⑧备注"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00031","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317258","source_hash":"18ab6599abaaab1b0c2d3168dcefac9927fba4a8f4198aa5790997f06040190d","text":"关系"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00032","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317259","source_hash":"b7c2240fa3101b1483437dee69796010ec511986db968f58fcd5a4940c91406d","text":"填写本人兵役详情等的指南"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00033","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317260","source_hash":"e946b07593a051a3231ca4a0334ca0a312252d7969dce09240520a22cec09337","text":"在①项的“政党归属”栏中，独立候选人应填写“独立”。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00034","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317261","source_hash":"5a9aedae047ddfcb21b9c821dcd572206d8e4e847260bf0efbe60b8062a4ea2f","text":"第二项，“选举名称和选区名称”栏中，总统选举、地方政府首脑选举、比例代表制国民议会选举和比例代表制地方议会选举必须填写选区名称。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00035","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317262","source_hash":"8f6a722fb4fba8ea1e4aeb02af1f78a61fef35d154bf60a4d655d7ad3b434e28","text":"不。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00036","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317263","source_hash":"140d1b411ba977edff5f80078af8cf7c13d1db9272247865007af3a06b94ddc5","text":"在 ③ 部分，“姓名”字段应以韩文填写。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00037","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317264","source_hash":"9a3eb66414bbc3ad452f8f7b03d15d25e242843b61f752acaa59ed95e8cd3f77","text":"④ 款“与当事人的关系”一栏指的是当事人及其配偶（总统令规定的人员，例如与负有申报义务的人员结婚期间已服完现役兵役的人员）和直系后裔（以及其他人员）。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00038","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317265","source_hash":"7a1e5e9b827edc37d8231bf8df5e92f139971128d01e7db676b2b915e007b0c7","text":"区分（包括孙子女），但包括直系后代（在报告义务生效年份的 1 月 1 日至 12 月 31 日期间年满 18 周岁的直系后代）。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00039","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317266","source_hash":"d304624f7947b624453d1abecf1c6c69fd141120b2c92e81a93463d024af7c5a","text":"后代按出生顺序排列如下。但免服兵役的女性和18岁以下的男性不在此列。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00040","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317267","source_hash":"b58fc7c2cb9e62141c660a71f71808532cff09e27a02f470d17bb8430e813d06","text":"“填写说明”"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00041","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317268","source_hash":"18d49ed52df710fe154d26a4b41f9822c6dd56427c78d80281b4ebd8401b6508","text":"1. 分类为本人、配偶、儿子、孙子和外孙"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00042","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317269","source_hash":"c3a5549e5ea588c3ce4bcb62e15e5b0e393635249d1a8b18047babe343216af9","text":"2. 如果是儿子，则列为“长子”、“次子”、“三子”等。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00043","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317270","source_hash":"44c4e3d9aa1f15e20a30e990533574e80ecb5720d98e7adb4d3cbaabd898b622","text":"3. 对于孙子和外孙，仅列出“孙子，外孙”"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00044","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317271","source_hash":"bd7a61f38602a9d9de5da9e709ab712de235d9772b935530e3e2d2b88de5956d","text":"在“项目⑤”中，“名称”字段应以韩文填写。"},{"id":"A31466-zh-00045","doc":"A31466","law_id":"kr-006034-285751-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2317272","source_hash":"d9ea2e01b4568f659640bc0b59d0fe00e047e46fef095decb00e6283ebab2f4b","text":"在第⑦项的“兵役详情”部分，应按地区兵务局